uage\": {\n        \"0\": \"en_US\"\n    }\n}','f4b5f5ec30544a3557302edf81392918',NULL,'2015-04-26 19:43:12','2022-07-20 17:12:56','2022-07-20 17:12:55'),('cdbd629e-a834-4d8f-9394-f559eeef9511','live',NULL,'/sites/neosdemo/features/imagetext/main/node524c21d53285a/column1/node524c2887753b8','afe00cb9-4166-c3d0-8ba3-6e9edad2cbe9',100,'{\n    \"text\": \"<p>Five and Seven said nothing, but looked at Two. Two began in a low voice, \\\"Why, the fact is, you see, Miss, this here ought to have been a red rose-tree, and we put a white one in by mistake; and if the Queen was to find it out, we should all have our heads cut off, you know. So you see, Miss, we\'re doing our best, afore she comes, to——\\\" At this moment, Five, who had been anxiously looking across the garden, called out \\\"The Queen! The Queen!\\\" and the three gardeners instantly threw themselves flat upon their faces. There was a sound of many footsteps, and Alice looked round, eager to see the Queen.<\\/p>\",\n    \"image\": {\n        \"__flow_object_type\": \"Neos\\\\Media\\\\Domain\\\\Model\\\\ImageVariant\",\n        \"__identifier\": \"b8062715-0885-8df4-3a19-508a1429c04a\"\n    },\n    \"caption\": \"<p><br\\/><\\/p>\"\n}','Neos.Demo:Content.TextWithImage',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,'{}',8,'/sites/neosdemo/features/imagetext/main/node524c21d53285a/column1','2f8d44c19697af7773596b2d077775fd','4f534b1eb0c1a785da31e681fb5e91ff','{\n    \"language\": {\n        \"0\": \"en_US\"\n    }\n}','7143dda1476f4be0888fb754e083f1f5',NULL,'2015-04-26 19:43:11','2022-07-22 15:53:57','2022-07-22 15:53:57'),('d001eb23-ac26-4f0e-8c2a-69c7f8b557e2','live',NULL,'/sites/neosdemo/node-iyyapnswso4eu/node-ts7s1ssmv6m3z/main/node-rvuo58wym8kew/column1','1da306c3-61dc-4d1e-a025-a344f3d5a199',200,'{}','Neos.Demo:Collection.Content.Column',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,'{}',2,'/sites/neosdemo/node-iyyapnswso4eu/node-ts7s1ssmv6m3z/main/node-rvuo58wym8kew','afdd1054231dc7855d54f078b7261f19','4f534b1eb0c1a785da31e681fb5e91ff','{\n    \"language\": {\n        \"0\": \"en_US\"\n    }\n}','af68c9036c78e52bf6cee034a7319a1b',NULL,'2023-03-24 16:58:01','2023-03-24 17:00:04','2023-03-24 17:00:04'),('d1833922-b1a7-4dab-9a2f-ffc4e257618e','live',NULL,'/sites/neosdemo/notfound/main/node-o07zq1gg92un6','c141039c-55e3-4a15-a5dd-aed4504374f3',100,'{\n    \"title\": \"<h1>Editable \\\"404 - Not Found\\\" Page!<\\/h1>\",\n    \"tagName\": \"h1\"\n}','Neos.Demo:Content.Headline',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,'{}',15,'/sites/neosdemo/notfound/main','4b28a366474a4e31181e6152908d34e0','4f534b1eb0c1a785da31e681fb5e91ff','{\n    \"language\": {\n        \"0\": \"en_US\"\n    }\n}','743ddbeb2c960ff2aa50346dc0ecfe7b',NULL,'2019-03-22 17:37:43','2022-07-22 14:12:43','2022-07-22 14:12:42'),('d29e1510-d6fb-44bc-97d3-ce8804d40c1f','live',NULL,'/sites/neosdemo/features/imagetext/main/node524c21d53285a','0e70da10-fc24-6459-19e9-254f76734e1b',300,'{}','Neos.Demo:Content.Columns.Two',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,'{}',4,'/sites/neosdemo/features/imagetext/main','60da23720a86846aae922b661087e79f','4f534b1eb0c1a785da31e681fb5e91ff','{\n    \"language\": {\n        \"0\": \"en_US\"\n    }\n}','653e468ba5b5133603a206805c7a987a',NULL,'2015-04-26 19:43:11','2019-02-25 17:17:22',NULL),('d32f0b29-f6b2-4155-8f80-018588fca3a4','live',NULL,'/sites/neosdemo/features/main/node524d96f6b1348/column1/node524da2620ae6d','696e0d88-91bb-b27f-39e8-0900076156cd',100,'{\n    \"title\": \"In-Page Editing\",\n    \"tagName\": \"h2\",\n    \"tagStyle\": \"h4\"\n}','Neos.Demo:Content.Headline',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,'{}',6,'/sites/neosdemo/features/main/node524d96f6b1348/column1','2b8daff6cdae1edac241111646e8e323','4f534b1eb0c1a785da31e681fb5e91ff','{\n    \"language\": {\n        \"0\": \"en_US\"\n    }\n}','628e15190d41e519a60f71b53766c6b0',NULL,'2015-04-26 19:43:11','2022-07-22 15:49:51','2022-07-22 15:49:51'),('d4209aa2-4a73-41d9-b143-e263a2ed8cb9','live',NULL,'/sites/neosdemo/features/main/node524c37db511d4/column0/node524c389335cf9','c7a32dbd-5c23-e651-561e-41880f36f9c2',100,'{\n    \"title\": \"What Makes Neos Special\",\n    \"tagName\": \"h2\",\n    \"tagStyle\": \"h4\"\n}','Neos.Demo:Content.Headline',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,'{}',6,'/sites/neosdemo/features/main/node524c37db511d4/column0','dd21d3319f482d398974a17ecdb84332','4f534b1eb0c1a785da31e681fb5e91ff','{\n    \"language\": {\n        \"0\": \"en_US\"\n    }\n}','4f8382fb47ce1ed2710d16c54ec43478',NULL,'2015-04-26 19:43:11','2022-07-22 15:49:51','2022-07-22 15:49:51'),('d503d01f-a2dd-4f81-b1d4-6d88f11e0e55','live',NULL,'/sites/neosdemo/features/main/node524c37db511d4/column1/node524c38e478450','732d2a69-6f2e-dbf0-67ac-632879f3f8fc',200,'{\n    \"text\": \"<p>We know that a website does not only contain static parts. In today\'s world, you often integrate external services, have to model complex business logic or tweak the output of the website in a very fine-grained way. That\'s why our main goal is developer happiness. We want you to be effective, being able to re-use concepts and code across your websites.<\\/p><p>Of course, that is no free ride: You need to learn the concepts used in Neos. However, by implementing established practices in software development, your knowledge can be applied to a wide variety of languages, frameworks and use-cases. We want to help you become better programmers!<\\/p><p>The Learn Once, Run Everywhere Philosophy is the main guidance principle for the development of Neos: All components are usable inside the CMS context, but also in stand-alone web applications. That of course also includes your own components.<\\/p>\"\n}','Neos.Demo:Content.Text',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,'{}',6,'/sites/neosdemo/features/main/node524c37db511d4/column1','0f9770a20a86b330ebc57de8f69001ac','4f534b1eb0c1a785da31e681fb5e91ff','{\n    \"language\": {\n        \"0\": \"en_US\"\n    }\n}','b95ea764248d305805f2946653afab0e',NULL,'2015-04-26 19:43:11','2022-07-22 15:48:33','2022-07-22 15:48:33'),('d5534e06-3607-4abd-b9b7-944d0167f948','live',NULL,'/sites/neosdemo/features/multiple-columns/main/node524a9dc707b81/co