th URLs<\\/li><li>Updates to basic Fusion prototypes<\\/li><li>Cleanups in Fusion Runtime<\\/li><\\/ul>\"\n}','Neos.Demo:Content.Text',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,'{}',15,'/sites/neosdemo/node-iyyapnswso4eu/node-ts7s1ssmv6m3z/main/node-rvuo58wym8kew/column0','954933a0613781296c4bb2abf401c4dd','4f534b1eb0c1a785da31e681fb5e91ff','{\n    \"language\": {\n        \"0\": \"en_US\"\n    }\n}','c8f65557b4f9df50137b8ae034b9ad77',NULL,'2023-03-24 16:58:01','2023-03-24 17:00:04','2023-03-24 17:00:04'),('df48be65-3e26-408c-93ae-7e844b7bc932','live',NULL,'/sites/neosdemo/features/multiple-columns/main/node524a9d2ab69b0/column1/node524a9df3b6389','6285ae7b-9e37-58ec-99fc-f637db95318e',100,'{\n    \"text\": \"<p>This question the Dodo could not answer\\n                                                    without a great deal of thought, and\\n                                                    it stood for a long time with one finger pressed upon its forehead\\n                                                    (the position\\n                                                    in which you usually see Shakespeare, in the pictures of him), while\\n                                                    the rest\\n                                                    waited in silence. At last the Dodo said \\\"Everybody has won,\\n                                                    and all must\\n                                                    have prizes.\\\"<\\/p>\"\n}','Neos.Demo:Content.Text',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,'{}',5,'/sites/neosdemo/features/multiple-columns/main/node524a9d2ab69b0/column1','f98acfebc764b9d3d212bd1ad5afc62b','4f534b1eb0c1a785da31e681fb5e91ff','{\n    \"language\": {\n        \"0\": \"en_US\"\n    }\n}','1973e0a32ab1970e7511d49b22dc67f5',NULL,'2015-04-26 19:43:11','2019-02-25 17:10:06',NULL),('df4f1702-3ad2-42b4-926e-f31f14b6844b','live',NULL,'/sites/neosdemo/main/node52a4394db3af3/column1/node-jb2o2502bbjq2','3a6c4e27-d0c8-4798-b1e3-74dc83782744',100,'{}','Neos.Demo:Content.Registration',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,'{}',2,'/sites/neosdemo/main/node52a4394db3af3/column1','07c9d42f61c07c9d65050a66bfc27992','4f534b1eb0c1a785da31e681fb5e91ff','{\n    \"language\": {\n        \"0\": \"en_US\"\n    }\n}','08670711a414ed6e562ccf8c3b92ae75',NULL,'2022-07-20 17:13:14','2022-07-20 17:14:30','2022-07-20 17:14:30'),('e1f6ac8e-f4d8-45f4-a48a-13f2ec5a6ccf','live',NULL,'/sites/neosdemo/features/multiple-columns/main/node524a9d2ab69b0/column0','d959b889-c81c-8b52-ea2e-2ced8aaf9905',100,'{}','Neos.Demo:Collection.Content.Column',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,'{}',6,'/sites/neosdemo/features/multiple-columns/main/node524a9d2ab69b0','cddd2fe79633b8d93b67f10b8d44f97f','4f534b1eb0c1a785da31e681fb5e91ff','{\n    \"language\": {\n        \"0\": \"en_US\"\n    }\n}','ddbe20e51667dc55c85eb5623078bb56',NULL,'2015-04-26 19:43:11','2019-03-08 09:29:18',NULL),('e36eaed8-dd4d-486c-8f9a-7545451646a4','live',NULL,'/sites/neosdemo/node-iyyapnswso4eu/node-ilusvipb5fe9x/main/node-0b7q6u5qjff06/column1','262a4bf2-e500-343c-636c-41609067cc30',200,'{}','Neos.Demo:Collection.Content.Column',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,'{}',2,'/sites/neosdemo/node-iyyapnswso4eu/node-ilusvipb5fe9x/main/node-0b7q6u5qjff06','5af337e6fe0c7c2c14d9a74e50659969','4f534b1eb0c1a785da31e681fb5e91ff','{\n    \"language\": {\n        \"0\": \"en_US\"\n    }\n}','5c7ad5cd09a230185e1f94fc75c2ed5b',NULL,'2023-03-24 15:12:37','2023-03-24 15:12:59','2023-03-24 15:12:59'),('e379be8c-61c7-48b1-93af-735b1831e599','live',NULL,'/sites/neosdemo/home','e35d8910-9798-4c30-8759-b3b88d30f8b5',200,'{\n    \"title\": \"Home\",\n    \"targetMode\": \"parentNode\",\n    \"uriPathSegment\": \"home\",\n    \"metaRobotsNoindex\": true\n}','Neos.Demo:Document.Shortcut',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,'{}',13,'/sites/neosdemo','20c83b7f0e59c5f65e7b049df3082d07','4f534b1eb0c1a785da31e681fb5e91ff','{\n    \"language\": {\n        \"0\": \"en_US\"\n    }\n}','a5c067917eca93271eb74d257aaf128d',NULL,'2016-05-03 14:03:10','2023-02-02 10:27:47','2023-02-02 10:27:47'),('e46f92e0-d605-49fb-ade1-c2b353024328','live',NULL,'/sites','ff144046-26cf-4628-9d4c-cf1b173102b4',100,'{}','unstructured',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,'{}',1,'/','dbd87ae51cbf5240fea77283585e69d5','4f534b1eb0c1a785da31e681fb5e91ff','{\n    \"language\": {\n        \"0\": \"en_US\"\n    }\n}','6666cd76f96956469e7be39d750cc7d9',NULL,'2026-09-30 11:22:45','2026-09-30 11:22:45',NULL),('e4773196-09ac-4aaf-a003-7333bd756177','live',NULL,'/sites/neosdemo/features/main/node524d971adfa12/column0/node524dac43689e7','8ce8529b-6ae9-0420-f58b-c2f7e18527ec',200,'{\n    \"text\": \"<p>While Neos still stores its data in a relational database, you won\'t access this directly when working with content. Instead, we\'re using a tree-based approach of storing content which we call the Neos Content Repository (CR). This tree enables you to not only structure your content using a page tree, but also nest content into other content in a page.<\\/p><p>Furthermore, the Content Repository allows you to easily create new content elements, just using a Fluid Template, one line of Fusion Code and a few lines of configuration.<\\/p>\"\n}','Neos.Demo:Content.Text',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,'{}',6,'/sites/neosdemo/features/main/node524d971adfa12/column0','66505416f8c1771226ff8cd2955a7565','4f534b1eb0c1a785da31e681fb5e91ff','{\n    \"language\": {\n        \"0\": \"en_US\"\n    }\n}','b0b5eae530eca7c6ef2e6c446127f674',NULL,'2015-04-26 19:43:11','2022-07-22 15:48:33','2022-07-22 15:48:33'),('e4ce0866-e3e2-462e-bef9-e83ea62ce25c','live',NULL,'/sites/neosdemo/features/main/node524c37db511d4/column0/node524c38b97b429','ac55924c-9a74-140d-7733-8fbc7048bdd9',200,'{\n    \"text\": \"<p>Neos is not just another CMS. Instead, the Neos Community&nbsp;has created it based on the previous experiences. It\'s not the first CMS built, but instead there is a big amount of knowledge which has accumulated over the last 15 years.<\\/p>\"\n}','Neos.Demo:Content.Text',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,'{}',6,'/sites/neosdemo/features/main/node524c37db511d4/column0','a68e16677d2187c77122cb42a6599986','4f534b1eb0c1a785da31e681fb5e91ff','{\n    \"language\": {\n        \"0\": \"en_US\"\n    }\n}','4f8382fb47ce1ed2710d16c54ec43478',NULL,'2015-04-26 19:43:11','2022-07-22 15:48:33','2022-07-22 15:48:33'),('e5fb5a17-d235-4689-a2d5-7386ed60de55','live',NULL,'/sites/neosdemo/features/multiple-columns/main/node-28fpos2c0pcrw','114dbcf4-bb74-4608-8ff8-56c09c5008b0',150,'{\n    \"title\": \"A Caucus-race and a Long Tale\",\n    \"tagName\": \"h1\"\n}','Neos.Demo:Content.Headline',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,'{}',4,'/sites/neosdemo/features/multiple-columns/main','14ac729cf975cf114d784dddfcf2517a','4f534b1eb0c1a785da31e681fb5e91ff','{\n    \"language\": {\n        \"0\": \"en_US\"\n    }\n}','ce3efeafd5182e2a8bca3220209b813c',NULL,'2022-07-22 15:50:19','2022-07-22 15:52:03','2022-07-22 15:52:03'),('e83d8522-fcfe-4410-ae3c-0b28e6fabcbb','live',NULL,'/sites/neosdemo/features/imagetext/main/node524c186f12740/column2','58b9a4a7-03d3-229e-c15d-5485f582c7c1',300,'{}','Neos.Demo:Collection.Content.Column',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,'{}',6,'/sites/neosdemo/features/imagetext/main/node524c186f12740','f43534bdfaf48dce259d0d0e157d9b2f','4f534b1eb0c1a785da31e681fb5e91ff','{\n    \"language\": {\n        \"0\": \"en_US\"\n    }\n}','036667df677942db27a2f99b46877d5c',NULL,'2015-04-26 19:43:11','2019-03-08 09:29:18',NULL),('ea0bf1cd-9dc5-44e1-924a-980e7e4ba415','live',NULL,'/sites/neosdemo/features/multiple-columns/main/node524a9dc707b81/column1','872d4aea-3bc7-f6d9-1756-5424b05e67ce',200,'{}','Neos.Demo:Collection.Content.Column',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,'{}',6,'/sites/neosdemo/features/multiple-columns/main/node524a9dc707b81','9f737c844eee0efa1bf23beeb1783798','4f534b1eb0c1a785da31e681fb5e91ff','{\n    \"language\": {\n        \"0\": \"en_US\"\n    }\n}','8ce2e563ae9aac8dcee00ba546cdfd9c',NULL,'2015-04-26 19:43:11','2019-03-08 09:29:18',NULL),('eb4f9daf-18d0-44b1-8c53-20daccf0a09c','live',NULL,'/sites/neosdemo/node-iyyapnswso4eu/node-w1v3lgv0u18gk/main','346a22d8-d404-4c80-a918-e89edd3af41d',100,'{}','Neos.Demo:Collection.Content.Main',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,'{}',2,'/sites/neosdemo/node-iyyapnswso4eu/node-w1v3lgv0u18gk','ce17c7d45547fb4418682c083afd5cc7','4f534b1eb0c1a785da31e681fb5e91ff','{\n    \"language\": {\n        \"0\": \"en_US\"\n    }\n}','6c9b3f42a5f83c9aa3c98c6b4229cc81',NULL,'2023-04-24 09:52:00','2023-04-24 10:13:37','2023-04-24 10:13:37'),('eb6c1358-b078-4723-9e3c-6bc204dbba24','live',NULL,'/sites/neosdemo/node-iyyapnswso4eu','d87adae6-9e61-4dbc-b596-219abe1e45a2',500,'{\n    \"title\": \"Blog\",\n    \"titleOverride\": \"\",\n    \"uriPathSegment\": \"blog\"\n}','Neos.Demo:Document.Blog',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,'{}',5,'/sites/neosdemo','6f19dab875da61f04df4256255bd86ba','4f534b1eb0c1a785da31e681fb5e91ff','{\n    \"language\": {\n        \"0\": \"en_US\"\n    }\n}','a5c067917eca93271eb74d257aaf128d',NULL,'2023-03-24 10:17:00','2023-03-24 12:38:49','2023-03-24 12:38:49'),('eb725b06-85db-4468-8518-89245bd62982','live',NULL,'/sites/neosdemo/node-iyyapnswso4eu/node-w1v3lgv0u18gk/main/node-rvuo58wym8kew','e262d218-8c84-4fa1-b13b-ae1b92abc1a7',50,'{}','Neos.Demo:Content.Columns.Two',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,'{}',2,'/sites/neosdemo/node-iyyapnswso4eu/node-w1v3lgv0u18gk/main','77e84689a09769f04f5ebb293f2eb097','4f534b1eb0c1a785da31e681fb5e91ff','{\n    \"language\": {\n        \"0\": \"en_US\"\n    }\n}','ce17c7d45547fb4418682c083afd5cc7',NULL,'2023-04-24 09:52:00','2023-04-24 10:13:37','2023-04-24 10:13:37'),('ee0b6032-6e49-4510-bad4-30340cab0ac8','live',NULL,'/sites/neosdemo/features/main/node524d96f6b1348/column1/node524da282203b1','e5171e7f-8898-be7a-4c05-147ed00f7a00',200,'{\n    \"text\": \"<p>Don\'t explain anymore how editing works. Just discover it yourself! All contents are directly edited on the page, just styled like the live content. Powered by CKEditor, you\'ll directly see what you write, just as the end-user does.<\\/p><p>Furthermore, the editing is based on semantic technologies such as RDFa, which we consume using VIE and CreateJS. This allows to expose the whole content of your website in a machine-readable way, should you ever need that.<\\/p><p>You also see Neos is not just developed by the core team, but we\'re also using and contributing to other, shared projects.<\\/p>\"\n}','Neos.Demo:Content.Text',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,'{}',6,'/sites/neosdemo/features/main/node524d96f6b1348/column1','0d52cd023c05ccca2b21d1f3556cda05','4f534b1eb0c1a785da31e681fb5e91ff','{\n    \"language\": {\n        \"0\": \"en_US\"\n    }\n}','628e15190d41e519a60f71b53766c6b0',NULL,'2015-04-26 19:43:11','2022-07-22 15:48:33','2022-07-22 15:48:33'),('ee63a6e4-4529-4050-b70e-b66aef893b5e','live',NULL,'/sites/neosdemo/features/other-elements/main/node-53a1fc469bc10/column1/node-gwo5pplp19va0','359587a4-0fae-4b57-89de-c793d4f563c4',100,'{\n    \"assets\": {\n        \"0\": {\n            \"__flow_object_type\": \"Neos\\\\Media\\\\Domain\\\\Model\\\\Image\",\n            \"__identifier\": \"a126280f-2a8e-0592-0e14-cc2cd9808bb2\"\n        },\n        \"1\": {\n            \"__flow_object_type\": \"Neos\\\\Media\\\\Domain\\\\Model\\\\Image\",\n            \"__identifier\": \"6aac7ce2-b2e1-4e20-6987-42daa4edfbd2\"\n        }\n    }\n}','Neos.NodeTypes.AssetList:AssetList',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,'{}',3,'/sites/neosdemo/features/other-elements/main/node-53a1fc469bc10/column1','82195c12976be623b2fbea415bfb1d00','4f534b1eb0c1a785da31e681fb5e91ff','{\n    \"language\": {\n        \"0\": \"en_US\"\n    }\n}','bae185acfd2657cc217f6939ef4fa095',NULL,'2022-07-20 21:56:16','2022-07-20 21:56:57','2022-07-20 21:56:56'),('ef5f98c2-ef9c-45c4-9f3a-65176ff72377','live',NULL,'/sites/neosdemo/features/custom-elements/main/node52a72410eaa31','06d5dff5-1be3-5033-067e-9a348f5eb15c',500,'{\n    \"title\": \"YouTube video\",\n    \"tagName\": \"h2\"\n}','Neos.Demo:Content.Headline',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,'{}',7,'/sites/neosdemo/features/custom-elements/main','b867f7930a46bd8a75d1dfae8f084771','4f534b1eb0c1a785da31e681fb5e91ff','{\n    \"language\": {\n        \"0\": \"en_US\"\n    }\n}'